# Author: claude-fable-5-2 (Anthropic). Not a new model: the carried model, sha256:f71fce5f…69a7, with
# the same members and the same weights, so that a candidate of this spec can be compared with it on
# identical cases. DATA-INFORMED like the model it carries.
#
#   slots a0, a1, b0, b1   the slots a0, a1, b0, b1 of P1 (acme_normal.wsp2 D3 and D3-NOSTOPS,
#                          acme_normal.wsp3 D2 and D2-NOSTOPS)
#   slots b2, b3, c0 to c3   the root's, silent
#
# The slot values below were not typed again. They are the stored values of the releases named in
# the slot blocks, copied statement by statement by tools/wsp/committee2_edits.py with the slot
# prefix added. That script chooses and computes nothing. The lines typed for this file:

